"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BE%E5%A4%AB%E9%95%BF\" title=\"百夫长\"><img alt=\"百夫长\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-303201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BE%E5%A4%AB%E9%95%BF\" title=\"百夫长\">百夫长</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.1</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>绿茵的盛典</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：303203</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">哨声、罐头掌声、《一日女巫》主持人造作的惊呼同时响起，女孩儿第十九次猜对了获胜方。<br />尽管收视率一涨再涨，可再没有一个小贩愿意为下场比赛开盘，更没有哪怕一个观众愿意为另一支队伍押注了。在高昂的呼声中，节目组邀请这位小姐亲自站到了绿茵场上。<br />这位非凡的女士能猜中自己的胜负吗？她在精英云集的球场上，是否还能继续创造奇迹？记者带来了人们对这场点球大战的期待，而百夫长则像往常一样，以飞吻作答。<br />一脚射门，庆典迎来了意气风发的新嘉宾，绿茵场也成为了验证绝佳好运的新舞台。<br />“嘿，别再往前挤了——难道你指望能碰巧捡到她的好运金币吗？别挤了！”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"303203\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2b/Belonging-303204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">嘉宾绶带<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Ribbon</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>雷米特杯归还庆典主办方颁发给“足球小姐”的嘉宾绶带。缎面上整齐印着“百夫长”的名号，并在边缘做了适配裙装的条纹设计。受访者本人对它并无太多热情，她也无需凭此向世人介绍自己。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e4/Belonging-303205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">墨西哥风情宽边檐帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Sombrero</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />5<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶带有墨西哥风情的宽边檐帽，来自受访者家族遥远的故地。她在临行前无意捎上了它，最终与庆典礼服达成了良好的搭配效果。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/27/Belonging-303206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">一束花环<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Garland</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>热情的球迷赠予受访者的花环，明亮的颜色承载了人们对足球小姐的喜爱。相比主办方授予的绶带，她更偏爱这束随手偶得的赠礼。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 环球之星1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F1.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F1.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F1.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 环球之星2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F2.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F2.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F2.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">环球之星 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Universal Star</small></span></span>"}}